  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- そびえ{立|た}つ: to stand towering (emphatic compound)\n- {山|やま}がそびえる: a mountain towers\n- {空|そら}にそびえる: to tower into the sky\n\nUSAGE: Often used in the compound そびえ{立|た}つ for extra emphasis. The ている form is most natural for describing a state of standing tall. Carries a sense of grandeur and impressiveness.",
